我冇權過問

297
00:20:05,645 --> 00:20:07,166
所以呢一個只係…

298
00:20:08,166 --> 00:20:09,767
我個人嘅願望嚟

299
00:20:14,049 --> 00:20:15,009
克里絲

300
00:20:15,489 --> 00:20:17,410
挺起自己嘅胸膛做人啊

301
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:20,051
Worth eclipsed

302
00:20:21,925 --> 00:20:25,327
Keep it until I
found you the trigger

303
00:20:25,367 --> 00:20:26,247
Killer

304
00:20:26,287 --> 00:20:27,327
I use the stone

305
00:20:27,367 --> 00:20:31,489
But it's you that'
s holding me down

306
00:20:31,529 --> 00:20:32,850
你試得嚟啊

307
